[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   TEP-9 step 003 -- CODE catalogue acquisition
[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   Acquires the CODE catalogue (Catalogue of Orbits and their Dynamical
[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   Evolution; Krolikowska & Dybczynski 2020, MNRAS 497, 1781) hosted on
[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   the Poznan comet-dynamics server pad2.astro.amu.edu.pl.
[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   The catalogue is served through a PHP search interface that renders
[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   three orbit-solution tables as HTML:
[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   code_original.html    -- original barycentric orbits
[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   code_osculating.html  -- osculating heliocentric orbits
[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   code_future.html      -- future barycentric orbits
[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   Reproduction policy
[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   1. The live catalogue endpoints are attempted first.  The pad2
[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   interface is a sessioned search application; if a live export is
[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   returned it is written with full provenance.
[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   2. If the live endpoint is unreachable or returns a non-table page,
[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   the versioned archival snapshots staged in data/raw/code/ are
[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   adopted.  Their SHA-256 hashes are recorded and logged loudly so
[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   provenance is never ambiguous.  These snapshots are the published
[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   catalogue content, not synthetic data.
[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   Outputs
[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   data/raw/code/code_{original,osculating,future}.html
[2026-09-20 10:40:38 UTC] [INFO    ] [STEP 003]   data/raw/code/provenance.json
